5,"w":320,"h":283,"title":"Approvals","body":"","color":"stone","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"designbrief-c2","type":"heading","x":40,"y":40,"w":1180,"h":67,"title":"Design brief — Kiln & Co. annual report","body":"A 24-page annual report for a community pottery studio, printed and as a PDF. It also needs to work as a fundraising pitch.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"designbrief-c3","type":"sticky","x":1260,"y":40,"w":380,"h":200,"title":"How to use this template","body":"Fill the brief together with the client in one session, then lock it. Anything not on this board is not in scope. When something changes, change the card and note the date in a comment.","color":"sky","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null},{"id":"designbrief-c5","type":"note","x":56,"y":335,"w":328,"h":147,"title":"Background","body":"Kiln & Co. is a not-for-profit studio that runs classes for 600 people a year. Last year’s report was a Word document. This year it has to persuade funders.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"designbrief-c4"},{"id":"designbrief-c6","type":"table","x":56,"y":498,"w":328,"h":260,"title":"At a glance","body":"","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"cells":[["Item","Detail"],["Client","Kiln & Co. (fictional)"],["Contact","Studio director"],["Print run","300 copies"],["Deadline","AGM, week 7"]],"sectionId":"designbrief-c4"},{"id":"designbrief-c8","type":"note","x":456,"y":335,"w":328,"h":127,"title":"Objective","body":"Make the studio’s impact obvious in two minutes of flicking — and help secure two new funders.","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"designbrief-c7"},{"id":"designbrief-c9","type":"table","x":456,"y":478,"w":328,"h":246,"title":"How we’ll measure it","body":"","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"cells":[["Measure","Target"],["Funder meetings booked","4"],["New funding secured","£30k"],["Report downloads","500"]],"sectionId":"designbrief-c7"},{"id":"designbrief-cb","type":"note","x":856,"y":335,"w":328,"h":107,"title":"Who","body":"Local councillors, trusts and arts funders. Busy, sceptical, used to glossy reports.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"designbrief-ca"},{"id":"designbrief-cc","type":"note","x":856,"y":458,"w":328,"h":107,"title":"Insight","body":"Funders remember one person’s story better than a page of numbers.","color":"sky","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"designbrief-ca"},{"id":"designbrief-cd","type":"image","x":856,"y":581,"w":328,"h":259,"title":"The people","body":"Photo: Pottery workshop at Odisha Crafts Museum 08 — Kritzolina. CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pottery_workshop_at_Odisha_Crafts_Museum_08.jpg","media":"@image:ph-db-pottery-class","filename":"ph-db-pottery-class.jpg","boardId":null,"sectionId":"designbrief-ca"},{"id":"designbrief-cf","type":"note","x":1256,"y":335,"w":328,"h":107,"title":"Key message","body":"Clay changes lives here — and here is the proof.","color":"sand","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"designbrief-ce"},{"id":"designbrief-cg","type":"note","x":1256,"y":458,"w":328,"h":127,"title":"Tone","body":"Warm, confident, hand-made but organised. Let the work and the people be the decoration.","color":"paper","tags":[],"comments":[],"items":[],"url":"","media":"","filename":"","boardId":null,"sectionId":"designbri